        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "界面顶部选择分类：炮弹、鱼雷、航弹、深弹、导弹。下方投入对应配方材料。",
            "en_us": "Pick a category at the top: shells, torpedoes, bombs, depth charges, missiles. Slot the matching ingredients below."
