        {
          "type": "indicate_success",
          "blockPos": [2, 1, 2],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "合成完成后弹药进入输出槽。可以一次性合成多组，耗时按数量线性增加。",
            "en_us": "Once finished the ammo lands in the output slot. You can craft many at once; time scales with quantity."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 1.5, 2.5],
          "color": "green",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ammo_automation",
      "title": {
        "zh_cn": "自动化：材料必须手动，产物可外接",
        "en_us": "Automation: Manual Input, Extractable Output"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "show_structure",
          "structure": "ponderer:basic"
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "piranport:ammo_workbench",
          "blockPos": [2, 1, 2],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "minecraft:hopper",
          "blockPos": [2, 2, 2],
          "blockProperties": {"facing": "down"},
          "attachKeyFrame": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "工作台不直接接收漏斗送入的材料。漏斗上的物品不会被自动消耗，必须在 GUI 内手动点配方。",
            "en_us": "The workbench does not pull ingredients from hoppers directly. Items dropped in by hoppers stay there until you pick the recipe manually."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 2.4, 2.5],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "minecraft:hopper",
          "blockPos": [2, 0, 2],
          "blockProperties": {"facing": "down"},
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "indicate_success",
          "blockPos": [2, 0, 2],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "产物（输出槽）可被下方漏斗取出，配合漏斗矿车或箱子形成自动化弹药供应线。",
            "en_us": "The output slot feeds a hopper below — pair it with chests or minecarts for an automated ammo supply."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 0.8, 2.5],
          "color": "green",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
